(7023847, 1064420, 60173, '<td valign="top">It looks to me like you did an overall sharpening to get the feller to pop more. He looks pretty darn good, but what has happened is the background noise that was probably minimal at the time of capture got brought out to a point of being distracting. I would recommend taking the extra time to select just what you want sharpened, so that other things don''t suffer for others'' greatness.<br/> <br/>Nice shot otherwise. The eye looks fantastic and the overall lighting is really nice.</td>', 'It looks to me like you did an overall sharpening to get the feller to pop more. He looks pretty darn good, but what has happened is the background noise that was probably minimal at the time of capture got brought out to a point of being distracting. I would recommend taking the extra time to select just what you want sharpened, so that other things don''t suffer for others'' greatness. Nice shot otherwise. The eye looks fantastic and the overall lighting is really nice.', '2013-04-20 14:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
