(7024531, 1064653, 119419, '<td valign="top">for the plucking ;)</td>', 'for the plucking ;)', '2013-04-22 00:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024532, 1064732, 28276, '<td valign="top">Oops.  I like where this was going.  Could have used a little more post processing, I think...  clone out some bits of yuck towards the ground and make the whole scene a bit more stark to help carry the weight of the subject.<br/> <br/>Over all, a very  good entry.</td>', 'Oops.  I like where this was going.  Could have used a little more post processing, I think...  clone out some bits of yuck towards the ground and make the whole scene a bit more stark to help carry the weight of the subject. Over all, a very  good entry.', '2013-04-22 00:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024533, 1063652, 119419, '<td valign="top">voluptuously grisly find, yum</td>', 'voluptuously grisly find, yum', '2013-04-22 00:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024534, 1063970, 28276, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field and nice framing.  Might have liked a bit more saturation and a better angle on the face.  Good catch.</td>', 'Good depth of field and nice framing.  Might have liked a bit more saturation and a better angle on the face.  Good catch.', '2013-04-22 00:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024536, 1064182, 28276, '<td valign="top">Spiders are soo cool.  Nice job here...  It would be really nice if she were set off from the background some more.  Spider and wood wash together a little...</td>', 'Spiders are soo cool.  Nice job here...  It would be really nice if she were set off from the background some more.  Spider and wood wash together a little...', '2013-04-22 00:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024537, 1063847, 119419, '<td valign="top">sometimes my insides feel like this. grossly good.</td>', 'sometimes my insides feel like this. grossly good.', '2013-04-22 00:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024538, 1064724, 28276, '<td valign="top">Now that''s ugly.  Not your picture, just the bug.  I might have liked to see more, though... not as tight of a crop.  Colors are really nice...</td>', 'Now that''s ugly.  Not your picture, just the bug.  I might have liked to see more, though... not as tight of a crop.  Colors are really nice...', '2013-04-22 00:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024539, 1064692, 119419, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2013-04-22 00:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024541, 1064393, 119419, '<td valign="top">and a nail biter ;) hideously real and funky</td>', 'and a nail biter ;) hideously real and funky', '2013-04-22 00:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024543, 1064730, 28276, '<td valign="top">It''s really hard to get good contrast in yellow flowers... You did that well here.  Good job with DOF and framing...  Bug himself is a little dull being all black w/ his face hidden.  But mostly I like this...</td>', 'It''s really hard to get good contrast in yellow flowers... You did that well here.  Good job with DOF and framing...  Bug himself is a little dull being all black w/ his face hidden.  But mostly I like this...', '2013-04-22 00:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024544, 1064723, 119419, '<td valign="top">nabbed it good</td>', 'nabbed it good', '2013-04-22 00:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024545, 1064729, 119419, '<td valign="top">At first it looks a little rude, but unusually sweet</td>', 'At first it looks a little rude, but unusually sweet', '2013-04-22 00:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024546, 1064531, 119419, '<td valign="top">love these, micro suburbia</td>', 'love these, micro suburbia', '2013-04-22 00:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024547, 1063704, 28276, '<td valign="top">I really like the desaturation and the water drops.  Sharpness is good.  Might have punched up the purple a little and definitely have gotten rid of the line (spider?) in the bottom left...</td>', 'I really like the desaturation and the water drops.  Sharpness is good.  Might have punched up the purple a little and definitely have gotten rid of the line (spider?) in the bottom left...', '2013-04-22 00:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024548, 1064345, 119419, '<td valign="top">brill ! ah the mood is thick. like.</td>', 'brill ! ah the mood is thick. like.', '2013-04-22 00:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024550, 1064084, 28276, '<td valign="top">Not overly happy w/ the color of the background (seems too reddish) or the framing, but I just love those eyes...  Very cool.</td>', 'Not overly happy w/ the color of the background (seems too reddish) or the framing, but I just love those eyes...  Very cool.', '2013-04-22 00:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024551, 1064669, 119419, '<td valign="top">handsome bugger, a great macro</td>', 'handsome bugger, a great macro', '2013-04-22 00:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024553, 1064439, 119419, '<td valign="top">nicely dark and moody</td>', 'nicely dark and moody', '2013-04-22 00:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024554, 1064224, 28276, '<td valign="top">Love the shallow DOF and how you got her mostly in focus.  A touch more of the green would be nice...  Would have really been cool if she''d been eating her mates head.  ;)</td>', 'Love the shallow DOF and how you got her mostly in focus.  A touch more of the green would be nice...  Would have really been cool if she''d been eating her mates head.  ;)', '2013-04-22 00:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024555, 1064692, 28276, '<td valign="top">Second favorite flower shot in this challenge (outside my own, of course)<br/> <br/>Focus is nice and in the right places.  Lighting is good and I like the color.<br/> <br/>Not sure I like the framing.  Might have prefered it square w/ the rose centered...</td>', 'Second favorite flower shot in this challenge (outside my own, of course) Focus is nice and in the right places.  Lighting is good and I like the color. Not sure I like the framing.  Might have prefered it square w/ the rose centered...', '2013-04-22 00:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024556, 1064341, 28276, '<td valign="top">Like the red/green contrast.  I''d have pulled off the discolored petals and cloned over the hole in the top left.  Is that a bug in there?  A close up of that center would have been cool, but would have lost the nice green background...</td>', 'Like the red/green contrast.  I''d have pulled off the discolored petals and cloned over the hole in the top left.  Is that a bug in there?  A close up of that center would have been cool, but would have lost the nice green background...', '2013-04-22 00:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024557, 1064648, 28276, '<td valign="top">I like this...  The color, tone, sharpness.   Would have cropped closer and gotten rid of some of the dust to the bottom right...</td>', 'I like this...  The color, tone, sharpness.   Would have cropped closer and gotten rid of some of the dust to the bottom right...', '2013-04-22 00:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024558, 1064303, 28276, '<td valign="top">The colors here are very nice and you did a great job w/ focus.  I just wish there was a more defined image in the drop.  Comes off just a little too abstract.</td>', 'The colors here are very nice and you did a great job w/ focus.  I just wish there was a more defined image in the drop.  Comes off just a little too abstract.', '2013-04-22 00:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024560, 1064575, 28276, '<td valign="top">Bet this freaked some voters out...  nice timing.<br/> <br/>Should have cloned out the dust in the eye.  Changing the saturation (down in the background and up on the snake) might have added a bit of punch along w/ the red of the tongue.</td>', 'Bet this freaked some voters out...  nice timing. Should have cloned out the dust in the eye.  Changing the saturation (down in the background and up on the snake) might have added a bit of punch along w/ the red of the tongue.', '2013-04-22 00:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024561, 1064560, 28276, '<td valign="top">Not sure what we''re holding on to... Dinner?  Eggs?  Either way it''s always cool to see bugs up close.  More face would be nice and a better leaf (too splotchy and so pale)  Nice red, though...</td>', 'Not sure what we''re holding on to... Dinner?  Eggs?  Either way it''s always cool to see bugs up close.  More face would be nice and a better leaf (too splotchy and so pale)  Nice red, though...', '2013-04-22 00:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024562, 1064635, 28276, '<td valign="top">I like the color and tone of this one...  might have liked it a bit sharper</td>', 'I like the color and tone of this one...  might have liked it a bit sharper', '2013-04-22 00:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024563, 1063450, 28276, '<td valign="top">I like the overall feel of this one and the way it was processed... Not sure if I like the crop and the border''s over large to me...</td>', 'I like the overall feel of this one and the way it was processed... Not sure if I like the crop and the border''s over large to me...', '2013-04-22 00:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024564, 1064434, 28276, '<td valign="top">Very good focus on the little critter.  Love his color.<br/> <br/>Wish you''d moved him to a nice big green leaf and cropped tighter though...</td>', 'Very good focus on the little critter.  Love his color. Wish you''d moved him to a nice big green leaf and cropped tighter though...', '2013-04-22 00:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024568, 1064438, 28276, '<td valign="top">Not really a fan of the High Key look, but I keep trying to figure out if that''s a ball sitting on it, or a drop falling and just about to hit.  You did make me stop and look...</td>', 'Not really a fan of the High Key look, but I keep trying to figure out if that''s a ball sitting on it, or a drop falling and just about to hit.  You did make me stop and look...', '2013-04-22 00:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024569, 1064307, 28276, '<td valign="top">I like the color and framing.  Would have liked more DOF (just a touch) and a softer light on the ladybug to remove that glare.  Over all, really nice.</td>', 'I like the color and framing.  Would have liked more DOF (just a touch) and a softer light on the ladybug to remove that glare.  Over all, really nice.', '2013-04-22 00:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024571, 1064480, 28276, '<td valign="top">I liked the way this is framed...  And i like the color.  Seems to loose a bit of detail as it moves right...</td>', 'I liked the way this is framed...  And i like the color.  Seems to loose a bit of detail as it moves right...', '2013-04-22 00:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024572, 1064433, 28276, '<td valign="top">I like the color and drops.  A bump in the yellow centers would have added, I think.  Slightly softer light might have helped, though the dark background really does set them off...  Dirt on the top right one is distracting</td>', 'I like the color and drops.  A bump in the yellow centers would have added, I think.  Slightly softer light might have helped, though the dark background really does set them off...  Dirt on the top right one is distracting', '2013-04-22 00:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024573, 1064656, 28276, '<td valign="top">I like where this was going, but I think it''s just too busy... I find it hard to really focus on any one part of it...</td>', 'I like where this was going, but I think it''s just too busy... I find it hard to really focus on any one part of it...', '2013-04-22 00:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024574, 1064420, 28276, '<td valign="top">Good focus and framing.  Nice and sharp.  I think the noise in the background is distracting and contrast seems a bit too heavy in his scales.</td>', 'Good focus and framing.  Nice and sharp.  I think the noise in the background is distracting and contrast seems a bit too heavy in his scales.', '2013-04-22 00:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024577, 1064475, 28276, '<td valign="top">Water beads were a nice touch.  Light seems too strong, making the blown highlights distracting...  Less of the seed ends and a colorful background would have been cool...</td>', 'Water beads were a nice touch.  Light seems too strong, making the blown highlights distracting...  Less of the seed ends and a colorful background would have been cool...', '2013-04-22 00:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024578, 1064479, 28276, '<td valign="top">Up and Down.  A nice picture and not much to nitpick.  Just not much there there...</td>', 'Up and Down.  A nice picture and not much to nitpick.  Just not much there there...', '2013-04-22 00:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7024580, 1064303, 97225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Top pick. 10</td>', 'Gorgeous. Top pick. 10', '2013-04-22 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
