(7024834, 1064726, 109387, '<td valign="top">When did you start taking macro shots?!<br/> <br/>Nice capture man. Great photographers can do everything ;)</td>', 'When did you start taking macro shots?! Nice capture man. Great photographers can do everything ;)', '2013-04-22 10:28:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7024839, 1064560, 86218, '<td valign="top">Well now look whos talking. A macro from Alex!! lol. TPL forces us in to styles we did not even think of doing hey. You just keep shooting the lady models hey.. This now a little lady bug I think the fact that you are not showing her best side is what pulled this shot down. Nice work</td>', 'Well now look whos talking. A macro from Alex!! lol. TPL forces us in to styles we did not even think of doing hey. You just keep shooting the lady models hey.. This now a little lady bug I think the fact that you are not showing her best side is what pulled this shot down. Nice work', '2013-04-22 10:41:05.000000', NULL, 0),
