(7025627, 1063761, 28276, '<td valign="top">Spring that was stopped before it fully sprung.  Nice.<br/> <br/>Like the image overall, but might have liked it more had the yellow and red been highlighted and the bluish tint been removed from the background.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1200837" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">(Sorry I missed you during voting)</a></td>', 'Spring that was stopped before it fully sprung.  Nice. Like the image overall, but might have liked it more had the yellow and red been highlighted and the bluish tint been removed from the background. (Sorry I missed you during voting)', '2013-04-23 17:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7025628, 1064393, 28276, '<td valign="top">Original, for sure.  Lots of great texture and grit, but I''ve never been a fan of this type of PP.   To me, the hands said enough of rugged toughness and the processing over-stated the obvious.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1200837" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">(Sorry I missed you during voting)</a></td>', 'Original, for sure.  Lots of great texture and grit, but I''ve never been a fan of this type of PP.   To me, the hands said enough of rugged toughness and the processing over-stated the obvious. (Sorry I missed you during voting)', '2013-04-23 17:50:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7025631, 1063846, 28276, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic/dynamic lighting...  Almost too bright in one spot.  Great contrast w/ the grey/green and red.<br/> <br/>The framing loses me a little, with all the space in the bottom corner but not enough to look intentional.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1200837" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">(Sorry I missed you during voting)</a></td>', 'Very dramatic/dynamic lighting...  Almost too bright in one spot.  Great contrast w/ the grey/green and red. The framing loses me a little, with all the space in the bottom corner but not enough to look intentional. (Sorry I missed you during voting)', '2013-04-23 17:52:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7025638, 1064531, 28276, '<td valign="top">Moss seems like it would be so cool to photograph up close like this (I''ve tried) but it doesn''t feel like it delivers.  It''s like taking a photo of the top of a forest w/o the misty hills, calm lake, or majestic mountains.  Just lacks focus...<br/> <br/>I do like the lighting, though...  As a whole, this makes me think of Christmas.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1200837" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">(Sorry I missed you during voting)</a></td>', 'Moss seems like it would be so cool to photograph up close like this (I''ve tried) but it doesn''t feel like it delivers.  It''s like taking a photo of the top of a forest w/o the misty hills, calm lake, or majestic mountains.  Just lacks focus... I do like the lighting, though...  As a whole, this makes me think of Christmas. (Sorry I missed you during voting)', '2013-04-23 17:56:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7025643, 1064441, 28276, '<td valign="top">Back-lighting was an interesting idea.  Really brings attention to the hairs along the edges.<br/> <br/>I might have liked a tighter crop though, showcasing just that curled bit at the end... Maybe w/ out the red string<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1200837" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">(Sorry I missed you during voting)</a></td>', 'Back-lighting was an interesting idea.  Really brings attention to the hairs along the edges. I might have liked a tighter crop though, showcasing just that curled bit at the end... Maybe w/ out the red string (Sorry I missed you during voting)', '2013-04-23 18:02:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7025644, 1064466, 28276, '<td valign="top">These pedals look like they were cut from pink velour.  Very cool.  More contrast might have brought out the texture some more...  I might have preferred a tighter crop on the one, or slide the framing over to the left some...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1200837" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">(Sorry I missed you during voting)</a></td>', 'These pedals look like they were cut from pink velour.  Very cool.  More contrast might have brought out the texture some more...  I might have preferred a tighter crop on the one, or slide the framing over to the left some... (Sorry I missed you during voting)', '2013-04-23 18:05:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7025646, 1064451, 28276, '<td valign="top">Color, framing, focus and background are all very good.  Title was clever.  Just wishing there was more of a story.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1200837" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">(Sorry I missed you during voting)</a></td>', 'Color, framing, focus and background are all very good.  Title was clever.  Just wishing there was more of a story. (Sorry I missed you during voting)', '2013-04-23 18:09:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7025647, 1064720, 28276, '<td valign="top">Wondering if this is big and shot to look small or something really small that''s shot so it looks too big.  This is a nice shot and would probably work well in a study/collection of other shots.<br/> <br/>While I like it, it doesn''t feel right for the challenge to me...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1200837" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">(Sorry I missed you during voting)</a></td>', 'Wondering if this is big and shot to look small or something really small that''s shot so it looks too big.  This is a nice shot and would probably work well in a study/collection of other shots. While I like it, it doesn''t feel right for the challenge to me... (Sorry I missed you during voting)', '2013-04-23 18:12:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7025648, 1064513, 28276, '<td valign="top">I like the motion.  Stopped it at just the right time.  Love the grass.  I would have liked more DOF, especially on the front paw.  Might have liked a puppy better, too ;)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1200837" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">(Sorry I missed you during voting)</a></td>', 'I like the motion.  Stopped it at just the right time.  Love the grass.  I would have liked more DOF, especially on the front paw.  Might have liked a puppy better, too ;) (Sorry I missed you during voting)', '2013-04-23 18:15:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7025649, 1063650, 28276, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in the background and the framing of this...  Fill light to bring the claw into colorful detail would have made this jump out...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1200837" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">(Sorry I missed you during voting)</a></td>', 'I really like the colors in the background and the framing of this...  Fill light to bring the claw into colorful detail would have made this jump out... (Sorry I missed you during voting)', '2013-04-23 18:17:26.000000', NULL, 0),
