(7025768, 1064287, 112828, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats...and don''t worry...my glasses were dirty the day I commented...lmao! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>??  Judi!  How could you say this?  Pamb''s shot is every bit as nice as many of Roz''s shots, and better than some of her stuff that''s even won ribbons.  Surely you just worded that poorly?  Why take back such a nice compliment?</td>', 'Originally posted by Judi: Congrats...and don''t worry...my glasses were dirty the day I commented...lmao!   ??  Judi!  How could you say this?  Pamb''s shot is every bit as nice as many of Roz''s shots, and better than some of her stuff that''s even won ribbons.  Surely you just worded that poorly?  Why take back such a nice compliment?', '2013-04-23 21:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
