(7025877, 1064737, 97225, '<td valign="top">Well this finished higher than it deserved to imo. That oof bud really bugs me. Thank you <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114225" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">giantmike</a> I will try that technique at some stage. I did take two shots and the bud was in focus in the other, and I successfully superimposed it in a combined version, but the two frames were not identical ( I didn''t use a tripod) so I couldn''t submit that version.</td>', 'Well this finished higher than it deserved to imo. That oof bud really bugs me. Thank you  giantmike I will try that technique at some stage. I did take two shots and the bud was in focus in the other, and I successfully superimposed it in a combined version, but the two frames were not identical ( I didn''t use a tripod) so I couldn''t submit that version.', '2013-04-23 22:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
